# Mentions must survive a page reload.
#
# Readiness is cleared only when this panel navigates the browser itself. A flag cleared by
# CEF's loading-state callbacks but restored only on a full main-frame load stays false
# forever in a live SPA - which parked every mention in the queue and never flushed it. This
# script exercises the case the flag exists for: reload, then drop.
toolwindow FoxxyCode
sleep 8
drag hello.txt
sleep 2
screenshot before-reload
# Toolbar Reload — the one path that legitimately tears down window.foxxycodeUi.
click //div[@myicon='refresh.svg']
sleep 8
screenshot after-reload
drag hello.txt
sleep 3
screenshot after-reload-drag
